#usda 1.0
# Locally authored viewer fixture: the default scene, a green wireframe torus.
# The wireframe is the geometry itself (linear BasisCurves: 18 circles around the
# axis and 36 rings around the tube; each closed by repeating its first point), so
# it draws as a wireframe in every draw mode and in OpenUSD's usdview.
# Major radius 1, minor radius 0.4; tilted toward the default front view.
# typescript-usd, Tomorrow Open Source Technology License 1.0 (see LICENSE).
